eset dungeon ratings and fixed generation issues with it\n- Increased card drop rates from 1 in 8 to 1 in 2\n- Increased corrupted enemy rates when at max level\n- Fixed fleeing, made some battle camera movements faster\n- Dungeon difficulty is now total of player ratings instead of combined average\n- Dungeon rating on victory is no longer split between each player\n- Endless dungeons now scale faster based on number of players","path":"/game/1117315411-adventure-story","slug":"1117315411-adventure-story","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3582b88df1cfc42930d03145000dafa31426258ba15dafcd022c65fdb35d25cf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e138e69056e4ab25dcef8c5694e5f643/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":12984925,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-01-16T05:07:32.817Z","creator":{"name":"vetexgames","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":171391948,"name":"[Sides] Vehicle Simulator","desc":"","path":"/game/171391948-vehicle-simulator","slug":"171391948-vehicle-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e77bb2a94951926cd7c9279aadcebea1447b8a2f663d47d4a5e6c8644ea1046d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8e2b3484a57548b7ac1bf28a59970a2c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-02T22:15:21.731Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":648362523,"name":"Breaking Point","desc":"Update V8.2\r\n - Default theme\r\n - New command: !join mode-name (e.g. !join fr)\r\n - Fixes","path":"/game/648362523-breaking-point","slug":"648362523-breaking-point","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0f2a85f1ac120d297fb32cbb2b1c7ff83915b0aca77a0d664a98609abc4431c7.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0136eb65b94aeb8de7a1c8063ec9a5e5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1358381997,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-22T23:08:45.517Z","creator":{"name":"Paradox","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":31,"freeCount":30,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":3}},{"id":680750021,"name":"Case Clicker","desc":"NEW UPDATE\n- HIGH ROLLER CASE\n- NEW SUPPLY DROP EXCLUSIVE\n- NEW INFINITE PACK EXCLUSIVE\n- NEW MISSION\n\n💸 Click to Earn CASE-BUX! \n📦 Open Cases & Collect Items! \n✅ Trade & sell items with other players! \n⚡️ Upgrade your stats!\n😎 Wear Special Items to BOOST your stats! \n🏆 Climb the leaderboards & become the ultimate clicker!\n\n🌟 Premium players & group members get 💎100 every hour!\n\n🔔 Follow to receive codes & be notified of new updates!\n\n⚠️ Accessories earned in-game are in-game ONLY and will not transfer to the website ⚠️\n\ntags: Trading, Case Opening, Case Simulator, Tapping, Limiteds, Unboxing Simulator","path":"/game/680750021-case-clicker","slug":"680750021-case-clicker","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4f8484da1364fd28fb71c02ece714c8dc2068c3b2e57fe9dec0e0de50c00161b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4c1d2ebc3395fb8404a73b96630bb0ab/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":94815573,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-21T20:51:00.733Z","creator":{"name":"Skilled Studio LLC","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":712717349,"name":"[EASTER🐰] Obby King Remastered","desc":"Obby King is a fast-paced obstacle course game built for players who enjoy competitive challenges and exciting gameplay. Race through 100+ unique obbies, beat the clock, and compete against other players in a single continuous tournament experience.\n\nThere are rounds. Whether you’re new to Obby King or an experienced obby player, the game is easy to pick up and challenging to master.\n\nStay focused. Move fast. Claim the crown.\n\nFeatures\n- Round-style gameplay - compete from start to finish\n- Time-based challenges - speed and accuracy matter\n- Progress-based competition - keep up to stay in the action\n- 100+ obby maps with increasi